re now just about one week away from the official Steam launch of Touhou Bansho Cards on October 26, 2026, at 7:00 PM PDT / 10:00 PM EDT (October 27 at 10:00 AM GMT+8)!Since our Playtest and Demo launched back in August, every single piece of feedback, bug repo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:34:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958460-1846018067926826","game_id":"steam-4958460","kind":"announcement","title":"Touhou Bansho Cards Launches October 27, 2026!","summary":"Exhilarating Combat! Infinite Combos & Full Barrage!Greetings, explorers of Gensokyo and fellow players!Hello everyone! This is EskiNott from EskiNott Game Studio, the developer behind Touhou Bansho Cards.Since our Playtest and Demo launched in August, we've received an overwhelming amount of invaluable feedback, bug reports, and passionate encouragement from all of you.Over these past months, we've poured our hearts into polishing the combat pacing, improving card and stat balance, and enhancin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T16:53:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926826","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958460-1842846814447150","game_id":"steam-4958460","kind":"update","title":"Game Update","summary":"# Game UpdateVersion: v0.3.26.9.4.20.20## What's New- Chapter 1 Corridor Anomaly offers have been reduced from 4 to 3.- Applied the event, reward, and die-check rebalancing.- Defeating 4 enemies grants 1 unrevealed Spell Card when one is available. Progress appears in the run summary.- Fixed battle opening, hand-reveal, skip-button, and battle HUD timing issues.- Fixed card tooltips, dynamic keywords, enemy values, shield displays, and run-inventory refresh issues.- Fixed completed Demo runs not","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T16:24:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447150","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958460-1842212951301630","game_id":"steam-4958460","kind":"announcement","title":"Touhou Bansho Cards Demo Is Live!","summary":"Touhou Bansho Cards Demo Launches August 28 at 11:30 AM UTC!Hi everyone, I'm the developer of Touhou Bansho Cards.The Touhou Bansho Cards Demo will be available to download on Steam on August 28, 2026 at 11:30 AM UTC.Since the Playtest ended earlier this month, I've continued working on the pacing of battles, combat presentation, and the content included in the demo. Thank you to everyone who joined the Playtest, sent feedback, or has been following the game.The Demo includes the full first chap","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T00:25:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951301630","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958460-1840310314343459","game_id":"steam-4958460","kind":"announcement","title":"The First Public Playtest for Touhou Bansho Cards Begins Today!","summary":"The First Public Playtest for Touhou Bansho Cards Begins Today!The Bansho Card Corridor is officially open to players!During this test, we would love to hear your thoughts on combat pacing, Spell Card and spirit-die builds, balance, interface clarity, and localization quality.Playtest ScheduleAugust 7, 2026 at 12:00 UTCto August 12, 2026 at 12:00 UTCThe test will remain open for five days.Available ContentChapter 1Spell Card and spirit-die deckbuildingCharacter rescues and Bond content up to Lv.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T00:34:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314343459","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4958460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:49Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4958460":"2026-10-26T15:38:49Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4958460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:49Z"},"5018120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:49Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4958460","app_id":4958460,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3033cd003effd4b3be0c617fb1448302fd0102319b76ecaae54b455d6bce1082","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Fight to the end! Once a card is played, don't stop. Push the Combo higher, break the damage limit, and blast through anything in your way!\r\nTouhou Bansho Cards is a roguelike deckbuilder. Collect cards, explore the Bansho Card Corridor, defeat Echoes, rescue Gensokyo's girls, uncover the truth.","publishers":[{"name":"EskiNott Game Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46210067}],"developers":[{"name":"EskiNott Game Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46210067}]},"release":{"